's tp_traverse), not a leaf of"] [902 1 "// this collection (cyLeaves), and able to take a probe's Go finalizer (a list's, a dictionary's or a cell's Go finalizer"] [903 1 "// may be tracemalloc's once it traced: then none of them)."] [916 3 "// a frame a Python object may hold (a traceback's, f_back's, gi_frame's), not running on a thread's stack,"] [917 3 "// not of a generator (the generator's slots fold it in: 222's rule)"] [927 1 "// cyWalkable is a generator whose frame's slots can be hidden (queue 224): suspended, with no pointer from its frame"] [928 1 "// back at it (a generator that reaches itself never has a probe run), and its frame not handed out: what else holds"] [929 1 "// an escaped frame is not in the graph."] [934 1 "// cyAllRefs makes cyTraverse list every object a slot holds, not only nodes (the shutdown's walk, exitRefs: queue 253)."] [939 1 "// cyForced are the dictionaries an exit collection gives as dead (queue 253, pylifecycle.go): seeds of the graph,"] [940 1 "// probed, never held, an edge into one reaching nothing; cyForcedSeeds the same as objects; cyWeakAlive, when set,"] [941 1 "// tells whether a weak reference to the trash is outside it (its callback called)."] [948 1 "// cyVisit is cyTraverse's visitor: a slot of the node, its kind (typed: a pointer of a concrete type, else an Object)"] [949 1 "// and the node it holds."] [952 1 "// cyTraverse is tp_traverse (queue 241; doc/python/PYTHON-SURVEY.md, \"Design: 241\"): f called with each slot of o (a"] [953 1 "// node) that holds a node. Only slots o owns alone are listed: a backing array shared with another holder would hide"] [954 1 "// that holder's reference. A reference the table does not list (a map's, a closure's, a field of a struct that is no"] [955 1 "// object) stays visible to Go's collector, which only keeps more alive."] [1023 20 "// handed out as an object: a node of its own (queue 241)"] [1030 31 "// _asyncio's Future or Task: the slots of a task's cycle (queue 224)"] [1149 1 "// cyGraph is the graph from the seeds (an object a probe would find held stays out of it), nil past cyMaxNodes."] [1197 1 "// cyRelevant is the nodes a probe must see: those of a strongly connected component with a cycle and a tracked node"] [1198 1 "// (Tarjan's, iterative), and what they reach. An acyclic dead object is Go's to find."] [1291 1 "// cyProbe asks Go's collector which of the nodes in are held from outside the set: the edges between them hidden, a"] [1292 1 "// probe's finalizer on each (a tracked node's own taken off), runtime.GC() with the GIL held, a wait until every"] [1293 1 "// probe ran or Go's finalizers have all run (finBarrier); then the slots put back and the probes taken off. The answer: the nodes"] [1294 1 "// reachable (held from outside, or reached from such a node through the edges)."] [1314 2 "// with its probe set each node outlives its last reference: what an earlier probe held is let go now"] [1402 1 "// cyHideRegistries takes the probed nodes out of the runtime's registries that hold their keys where CPython holds"] [1403 1 "// nothing (queue 241, \"Design: 241\": the weak registries): id()'s identities of untracked objects and the functions'"] [1404 1 "// annotations. The returned function puts back the reachable nodes' entries once the answer is read; the trash's go"] [1405 1 "// (a tracked node's identity into its record), so that Go can free it."] [1439 22 "// the trash's identity in its record, should a finalizer resurrect it"] [1450 1 "// cyDebug (PYI_GC_DEBUG=1): each probe prints to stderr its nodes held from outside that no other probed node holds,"] [1451 1 "// the roots of what it keeps (queue 241: what to look at when a cycle is not found)."] [1486 1 "// cySetFinalizer gives n's object the probe's Go finalizer (a tracked node's own taken off first: Go allows one)."] [1495 1 "// cyRestore gives a surviving tracked node its own Go finalizer again (its record dropped when it needs none)."] [1512 1 "// cyClearWeak